    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vss",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 2,
      "content_html": "<p onclick=\"steal()\" style=\"color:red\" class=\"lead\">Markup from <a href=\"javascript:alert(1)\" title=\"t\">a stranger</a>, <a href=\"https://site.example.net/a?b=1&amp;c=2\" target=\"_blank\">a link</a> and <a href=\"tel:+15550100\">a phone</a>.</p>\n<script>alert(1)</script><style>p{display:none}</style>\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/x\"></iframe>\n<p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,AAAA\" alt=\"inline data\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://images.example.org/k.png\" alt=\"kite\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"10\"></p>\n<font color=\"red\">unwrapped <b data-x=\"1\" data-blyg-note=\"kept\">bold</b></font>\n<svg><circle r=\"4\"/></svg><form action=\"/x\"><input value=\"v\"></form>\n<table><tr><td style=\"x\" colspan=\"2\">cell</td></tr></table>\n<p>Sneaky <a href=\"java&#x09;script:alert(2)\">entity</a>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vh1",
      "kind": "thread",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 2,
      "content_html": "<h1 id=\"field-notes\">Field <em>notes</em> &amp; tides</h1>\n<p>The harbour fills twice a day.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vh2",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<h3></h3>\n<p>An empty heading falls back to the excerpt.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vh3",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<p>A lead line comes first.</p>\n<h2>A later heading</h2>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vh4",
      "kind": "thread",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "\n<H2>A rather long heading that keeps going well past the eighty character label limit, on purpose</H2>\n<p>Body.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vh5",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<header>Not a heading tag</header>\n<p>Body.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vm1",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<p>Euler: <math><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{i\\pi}+1=0</annotation></semantics></math> holds.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vm2",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<p>Shown:</p>\n<math display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{a}{b}</annotation></semantics></math>\n<p>Bare <math><mi>y</mi></math> gone, and <math><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding=\" TEXT/X-TEX \">q_1</annotation></semantics></math> kept.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vm3",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<p>Hostile <math><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> and <math><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation><script>alert(2)</script><mtext><img src=x onerror=alert(3)></mtext></math> and <math><mrow><math><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></math></mrow></math> end.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vm4",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<p>Bad <math><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{</annotation></math> and <math><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cancel{x}</annotation></math> end.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vq1",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<p>Rules of thumb:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Write it down.</li>\n<li>Keep it small.</li>\n<li>Read it back.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>That is all.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "01j9zq3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1vq2",
      "kind": "fragment",
      "status": "public",
      "version": 1,
      "content_html": "<ul>\n<li>tools\n<ul>\n<li>a pencil</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>patience</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
